Make sure that your nethack.cnf don't contain something like
OPTIONS=!color or options=nocolor.  Try to put in a line with options=color
or use SET NETHACKOPTIONS=color before you start it.  Also make sure that your pc
is set up for using color.  They usually are, but you may try
MODE CO80,25 to be sure.  And make sure that your ansi.sys (or similiar
utility) support color.  The standard ansi.sys that comes with msdos support
color, perhaps you are using another one?  Make sure that your
config.sys file contains something like this:
DEVICE=dos\ansi.sys
Happy hacking!

